on_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-061-lukai:line048","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-061-lukai"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"t-wu061-t-wu061-lukai15","person_id":"hj9_ig8_998","kind":"office","title":"中書令","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"本句所載職官，任免時間未詳。","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-061","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-061-lukai","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-061-lukai","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-061-lukai:line042","quote":"　　建衡元年，疾病。皓遣中書令董朝問所欲言，凱陳：“何定不可任用，宣授外任，不宜委以國事。奚熙小吏，建起浦裡田，欲復嚴密故跡，亦不可聽。姚信、樓玄、賀劭、張悌、郭逴、薛瑩、滕脩及族弟喜，抗，或清白忠勤，或姿才卓茂，皆社稷之楨干，國家之良輔。願陛下重留神思，訪以時務，各盡其忠，拾遺萬一。”遂卒，時年七十二。","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-061-lukai:line042:m0015"}],"attestations":[{"id":"t-wu061-t-wu061-lukai15:a","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-061-lukai:line042","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-061-lukai:line042:m0015","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"中書令","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","model":null}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p030","text":"天璽元年，吳郡言臨平湖自漢末草穢壅塞，今更開通。長老相傳，此湖塞，天下亂，此湖開，天下平。又於湖邊得石函，中有小石，青白色，長四寸，廣二寸餘，刻上作皇帝字，於是改年，大赦。會稽太守車浚、湘東太守張詠不出筭緡，就在所斬之，徇首諸郡。秋八月，京下督孫楷降晉。鄱陽言歷陽山石文理成字，凡二十，云「楚九州渚，吳九州都，揚州士，作天子，四世治，太平始」。又吳興陽羨山有空石，長十餘丈，名曰石室，在所表爲大瑞。乃遣兼司徒董朝、兼太常周處至陽羨縣，封襌國山。明年改元，大赦，以恊石文。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":80,"last_line":80,"raw_start":13110,"raw_end":13667,"raw_character_offsets":[13122,13123,13124,13125,13133,13134,13135,13136,13137,13138,13139,13140,13141,13142,13143,13144,13145,13146,13147,13148,13149,13150,13151,13152,13153,13154,13155,131